#: ../../administration/settings/guidance.rst:2
msgid "Overview"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/settings/guidance.rst:4
msgid ""
"|morpheus| guidance is an important tool that makes recommendations for "
"resource and cost optimization. It analyzes CPU, memory, and storage "
"activities over time to make intelligent recommendations on sizing and "
"power state. These recommendations can free up resources and save "
"organizations significant amounts of money over time. Out of the box, "
"|morpheus| is configured for sensible thresholds used in making these "
"recommendations but they can be edited here if needed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/settings/guidance.rst:6
msgid "Note"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/settings/guidance.rst:6
msgid ""
"These thresholds evaluate managed workload metrics over time to produce "
"resize recommendations. They do not control the instantaneous appliance "
"memory warnings shown under Administration > Health. See "
":doc:`/administration/health/health` for those formulas and thresholds."
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/settings/guidance.rst:9
msgid "Power Settings"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/settings/guidance.rst:11
msgid ""
"|morpheus| will recommend shutting down a resource if *all* three of the "
"baselines in this section are exceeded:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/settings/guidance.rst:13
msgid ""
"**Average CPU (%):** Shutdown will be recommended if the average CPU "
"usage is below this value. Values over 100% are possible as this value "
"factors the number of CPU cores. Default value: 75"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/settings/guidance.rst:14
msgid ""
"**Maximum CPU (%):** Shutdown will be recommended if the CPU usage never "
"exceeds this value. Values over 100% are possible as this value factors "
"the number of CPU cores. Default value: 500"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/settings/guidance.rst:15
msgid ""
"**Network Threshold (bytes):** Shutdown will be recommended if the "
"average network bandwidth is below this value. Default value: 2000 "
"bytes/second"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/settings/guidance.rst:18
msgid "CPU Up-size Settings"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/settings/guidance.rst:20
msgid ""
"CPU up-size will be recommended when *both* of the following baselines "
"are exceeded for a resource:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/settings/guidance.rst:22
msgid ""
"**Average CPU (%):** CPU up-size is recommended if the average CPU "
"percentage exceeds this value (and other criteria are also met). Default "
"value: 50"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/settings/guidance.rst:23
msgid ""
"**Maximum CPU (%):** CPU up-size is recommended if the maximum CPU "
"percentage exceeds this value. Default value: 99"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/settings/guidance.rst:26
msgid "Memory Up-size Settings"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/settings/guidance.rst:28
msgid ""
"Memory up-size will be recommended when both of the following thresholds "
"are met for a resource:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/settings/guidance.rst:30
msgid ""
"**Minimum Free Memory (%):** Memory up-size will be recommended if free "
"memory dips below this value. Default value: 10"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/settings/guidance.rst:33
msgid "Memory Down-size Settings"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/settings/guidance.rst:35
msgid ""
"Memory down-size will be recommended when both of the following "
"thresholds are met for a resource:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/settings/guidance.rst:37
msgid ""
"**Average Free Memory (%):** Memory down-size is recommended if the "
"average free memory is above this value. Default value: 60"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/settings/guidance.rst:38
msgid ""
"**Maximum Free Memory (%):** Memory down-size is recommended if free "
"memory has never dipped below this value. Default value: 30"
msgstr ""

